==Battleground==
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1 second<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 100~133.33 seconds<sup>3,000f~4,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
this stage is essentially the original, with the addition of Zigges and Zir Zeals shaking up the mix. To complete this stage, use the original guide as well as bringing any Anti-Zombie units you own, such as [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener]] or [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu]].

